# Licensed BADA 3.15 phase/configuration and lateral-limit observation gate.
# Run with: IC research/pybada3-envelope-observe
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === BADA 3.15 PHASE AND LATERAL OBSERVATION GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO Duplicated takeoff, climb, cruise, approach, and landing points remain envelope OFF.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT A320 resolves to A320__ through bada3-code with strict valid evaluations and zero misses.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST ERROR Stop if configuration or civilian maximum bank is unknown, non-finite, or unstable within a pair.
00:00:00.18>ECHO TEST INFO PYBADATEM loads without requiring BADA 4 before PERFMODEL selects BADA 3.15.
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.25>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.30>PERFMODEL BADA3
00:00:00.35>DT 0.05
00:00:00.40>DATE 11,8,2026,12:00:00

00:00:01.00>CRE TO1,A320,41.300,2.100,90,200,140
00:00:01.05>CRE TO2,A320,41.310,2.100,90,200,140
00:00:01.10>CRE IC1,A320,41.320,2.100,90,800,180
00:00:01.15>CRE IC2,A320,41.330,2.100,90,800,180
00:00:01.20>CRE CR1,A320,41.340,2.100,90,20000,250
00:00:01.25>CRE CR2,A320,41.350,2.100,90,20000,250
00:00:01.30>CRE AP1,A320,41.360,2.100,90,5000,180
00:00:01.35>CRE AP2,A320,41.370,2.100,90,5000,180
00:00:01.40>CRE LD1,A320,41.380,2.100,90,1000,140
00:00:01.45>CRE LD2,A320,41.390,2.100,90,1000,140
00:00:01.50>DYNAMICS TO1 KINEMATIC
00:00:01.51>DYNAMICS TO2 KINEMATIC
00:00:01.52>DYNAMICS IC1 KINEMATIC
00:00:01.53>DYNAMICS IC2 KINEMATIC
00:00:01.54>DYNAMICS CR1 KINEMATIC
00:00:01.55>DYNAMICS CR2 KINEMATIC
00:00:01.56>DYNAMICS AP1 KINEMATIC
00:00:01.57>DYNAMICS AP2 KINEMATIC
00:00:01.58>DYNAMICS LD1 KINEMATIC
00:00:01.59>DYNAMICS LD2 KINEMATIC
00:00:01.60>ALT TO1 5000 1500
00:00:01.61>ALT TO2 5000 1500
00:00:01.62>ALT IC1 5000 1500
00:00:01.63>ALT IC2 5000 1500
00:00:01.64>ALT AP1 1000 -1000
00:00:01.65>ALT AP2 1000 -1000
00:00:01.66>ALT LD1 0 -500
00:00:01.67>ALT LD2 0 -500
00:00:01.68>ENVELOPE TO1 OFF
00:00:01.69>ENVELOPE TO2 OFF
00:00:01.70>ENVELOPE IC1 OFF
00:00:01.71>ENVELOPE IC2 OFF
00:00:01.72>ENVELOPE CR1 OFF
00:00:01.73>ENVELOPE CR2 OFF
00:00:01.74>ENVELOPE AP1 OFF
00:00:01.75>ENVELOPE AP2 OFF
00:00:01.76>ENVELOPE LD1 OFF
00:00:01.77>ENVELOPE LD2 OFF
00:00:01.80>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada3-envelope-observe.csv
00:00:02.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Recording stable, straight operating points without bank or heading changes.
00:00:02.10>PERFSTATUS ALL
00:00:07.00>PERFSTATUS ALL
00:00:08.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:08.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_bada3_observation.py on output/pybada3-envelope-observe.csv.
00:00:08.20>ECHO TEST EXPECT No QUALITY events, no limiting, no negative load bound, and identical evidence within each pair.
00:00:09.00>HOLD
